        "review_id": "415783177",
        "gold": "positive",
        "predicted": "mixed",
        "comments": "If you are ever in Toronto you must stay here! Absolutely unparrelled views of the CN Tower and entertainment district and great flat (stylish, well decorated and more than functional). Lifts got a bit annoying as they often took ages to arrive but absolutely nothing that the host could have done about it and Idrees was a fantastic host- super quick and responsive. Would fully recommend!"
