      {
        "review_id": "456458273",
        "gold": "positive",
        "predicted": "mixed",
        "comments": "Great place to stay at. The apartment was a lot bigger than I expected and I loved how the hosts included amenities you would only get at a hotel. The WiFi connection was great; we were able to stream without any issues. Bed was comfy and extra blankets were provided.  The location was perfect!  A convenience store and a Tim Hortons at your doorstep; the subway was about 2 blocks away which was perfect for getting around. The hosts were already very quick to respond whenever I had a question. All around great deal."
      },
      {
