        "predicted": "positive",
        "comments": "The location was perfect for seeing our family.  The room is a studio, so it is small and its perfect for crashing and relaxing.  Lots of information from the host as to things to do!  We were there to see family, so the agenda was full.  There are 3 sets of locks to get in, this is good on one hand challenging when carrying luggage in.  <br/>The biggest negative was not having a way to know about the party going on in the room down the hall till 2am, so while it says private room.  Its a converted hotel, and very cool!  Yet we didnt know about the other rooms being allowed to party till the early morning.<br/>I would stay again.<br/>Bob"
